Description: Preserve valid stcodec frames across flush on K3
 Remove the fixed ten-frame discard workaround after MPP k3.8 made capture
 buffer flushing and stale frame returns safe. Log normal EOS, flush and
 resolution events at debug level while preserving real error reporting.
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed

